: discover-capture-layer
:
: VK_IMPLICIT_LAYER_PATH is set for the duration of this one invocation
: only (Testscript env), to the manifest file itself from $layer_json
: (buildfile variable, see ./buildfile). It replaces the loader's standard
: implicit-layer search paths, so no system- or user-registered RenderDoc
: layer is picked up.
: ENABLE_VULKAN_RENDERDOC_CAPTURE is the manifest's own activation gate
: (VULKAN_ENABLE_VAR), which enumeration does not actually require, but it
: is set anyway to exercise the manifest as actually written.
:
env VK_IMPLICIT_LAYER_PATH=$layer_json ENABLE_VULKAN_RENDERDOC_CAPTURE=1 -- $*
